Research, SGI adopted Alpha (that's what's in the T3D and T3E boxes).

SGI also made the dreadful mistake of selling off some key technology
(at an absurdly low price) to Scott McNealy. Scooter's currently raking
in big bags of money with one fruit of this technology--the Starfire.

Whatever, we all have 20-20 hindsight in this business. Not even the
notorious Charlie Matco is clairvoyant ;-}

