I know that the VS2000 will work with the following 19" monitors:

	Monochrome: VR260, VR262
	Color: VR290, VR299

There are some smaller variants of these monitors which will also work.

The trick can be the cable.  If you don't have a color graphics board,
make sure that you use a mono cable.  If you do have a color graphics
board, make sure that you use a color cable.

If you are connecting a mono cable to a color monitor (or vice versa),
make sure that you use the green connection.

