I've got a RX23-A and was going to put it in a DECstation 3100, but
the eject button and the 3100 front panel bezel did not want to match up.
I noticed that the drive had a manufacturer's part number on it and
that number corresponded to a standard 3.5" 1.44mb drive, although
I don't recall the manufacturer's name right off, it was a common one.
