In general, AlphaStations will run both VMS and WNT.  In particular, I
know the AlphaStation 200s and 255s will.

Also, the AXP 150 (aka Jensen, aka DEC 2000-300) used to be sold as the
"Universal" platform because VMS, WNT, and Unix were all supported on
it.  This is the original Alpha box and is long discontinued, but can be
found quite inexpensively these days.  The biggest limitation is that it
is EISA based and not PCI.

