You want Word 97.  I believe that Microsoft has a native Alpha version
of Word 97.  Alternately, the Intel version of Word 97 runs quite well
on the Alpha with FX!32.  I recently set up Office 97 on an Alpha with
FX!32 V1.4.  I was plesantly surprised to see that even the SR-2 update
for Office installed without any problems.

