SBus interfaces and HP K series which pre date the V Class
use 160 or is it 180 MB/s HP-HSC busses. 

If HP had opted for 64bit PCI then the story would be 
different but they did not.

Finally PCI availability is relative, you can get the 
cards but you still need the HP-UX drivers and there 
are still very few for the V Class mainly because 
for some time it was HP's only PCI based system.
