On my AlphaStation 255 I need the firmware cd to switch between arc and
srm.
Just insert the firmware CD and type
>>> set os_type nt
>>> boot -fl 0,a0 dka400 (dka400 being your cdrom)
Apu-> update arc
Reply 'y' to the question do you want to Program Device.
Reboot the machine.

I don't know if it can be done without the Firmware update CD.

