Stuart J Campbell  <"stuartjc(thatsme)"@dynamite.com.au> wrote:
>Rev. Don Kool wrote:
>> > That is not a fix. It looks more like something MS would do.

>>         They must be doing something right.  They're taking over.  :-)

>Heh. Guess you haven't been watching the market lately have you. It IS
>worth a smile, i guess, to look back on the time when we thought that
