>I was told (by somebody who may or may not know what he's talking about) to
use
>CTRL-F2 to toggle printing, but I get no print.

Ctrl-F2 *does* toggle Auto Print mode, which causes all future lines from
the host to be sent to the printer.  You may want to try getting a screen
print to work first, which is done with F2 by itself.

